/Alt (Cracku has been a vital part of the toolkit. I specifically relied on their dailytargets. The quality is top notch and it's the best way to stay consistent. Thequiz section rarely pushes your logic with exam-level questions. What I findmost helpful is the video solutions; they break down complex steps muchfaster than a text explanation ever could. If you want to sharpen your prepwith high-quality structured content, definitely give Cracku a look. Good luck!)
